# Payload / Newsroom Rules

- Follow `data-model.md` and `newsroom-cms.md`.
- Reporters/correspondents cannot publish directly.
- Enforce workflow transitions server-side.
- High-risk content escalates.
- Private source info never enters public API/Search/analytics.
- Use versions on major editorial collections.
- Record EditorialActivity for workflow events.
- Breaking Fast Lane stays minimal/mobile.
- Do not over-customize Payload beyond required P0/P1 views.
- Jobs must be observable/retryable.
- Significant privileged mutations create audit events.
